          "pseudocode": "\n/* WARNING: Globals starting with '_' overlap smaller symbols at the same address */\n\nvoid FUN_0047b550(void)\n\n{\n  if (DAT_00533878 != 0) {\n    _DAT_00506694 = 0xfffffed4;\n    (**(code **)(*DAT_005065bc + 0x3c))(DAT_005065bc,0xfffffed4);\n  }\n  return;\n}\n\n",
